WEBVTT

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.960
It's changed a lot!

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.830
Yeah.  It's no longer Satellite.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:34.080
The power of the citizens 
are rebuilding this city.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.480
Crow!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.890
Long time, no see!

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.710
Yusei and Jack are also here!

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.700
Thanks for coming, Yusei, Crow, Jack.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.170
You seem to have settled in.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.140
It's comfortable.  I like living here.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.530
Are you kids behaving?

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.150
Of course!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.040
We're even doing our homework everyday.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.120
Are you giving Martha a hard time?

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.590
They're better kids than 
when you were a child.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.060
Ouch!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.190
Enough chitchat.  Let's go inside.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:28.250
There's something I wanted to tell you.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:31.810
You heard that a meteor landed 
on the city outskirts, right?

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:32.790
Yeah.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:35.460
That area is off-limits.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.180
I heard a strange rumor.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.510
Strange rumor?

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:45.000
It wasn't a meteor, but a stone tablet.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.110
The Public Maintenance Department 
secretly retrieved it.

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.280
A stone tablet?

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.270
Come to think of it, that's 
when Ghost appeared.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.190
Are they related?

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.710
I don't know.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.920
But I feel that something 
is happening in the shadows.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:06.400
Ghost has the power to seal 
away Synchro Monsters.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.450
Whatever you do, don't let your guard down.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:10.210
Yeah.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:37.050
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:42.590
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:47.060
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:52.900
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.870
There's no need to fear

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:05.550
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:11.550
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:17.320
Streak to the infinite future

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:22.730
Dreams surpass their limits

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:30.840
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:03.140
Old Man's MemoriesScrap Iron Family Deck

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.970
How troubling.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.020
Tetsuzou is pretty old.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.680
What's up?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.010
Hi, everyone.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.930
Martha is worried.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.000
What's wrong?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:20.100
An old man is living by himself at 
the outskirts of the former City.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.500
We're worried because he's all alone, 
so we invited him to live here.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.480
But he's stubborn, so he won't agree.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.950
Crow, you have to do something.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.550
Me?  Convincing an old man isn't my-

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:37.020
Yeah, Crow won't be able to do it.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:37.990
What?

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.990
Yeah, he can't.

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.190
Totally impossible.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.660
What do you mean, impossible?

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:46.730
I'll show you!  I'll take 
care of that old man!

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.990
Crow...

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.900
Leave everything to me!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.870
Where's that old man?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.100
Crow never changes.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.030
It's easy to manipulate him.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.920
Dad, let's duel.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.060
Kouki…

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.570
What's this?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.700
It's a mountain of junk.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.840
It's like a fortress.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.870
He's living here by himself?

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:37.750
Yeah.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.750
Well, let's enter!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.750
Don't come any closer!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:44.220
That's the old man.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.420
Hey, old man!

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.130
Do you want to live at Martha's place?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.850
This is my home!  I have no desire to move!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.810
But isn't it hard to live alone?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:58.240
Stop treating me like the elderly!  Go home!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:01.890
Interesting…  I'll bring you out by force!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.610
Stop, Crow!

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:07.910
I activate a trap.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.820
I'll get you, no matter what!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.350
He's persistent.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.390
Whatever!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:28.970
It's a double-layered trap that 
anticipates the opponent's actions.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.170
It's an effective trap.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:32.980
It's not the time to be impressed!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:36.890
Old man, I'll make it through by force!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.310
He doesn't give up.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.690
Crow!

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.690
Ouch…

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.030
This place is…

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.040
It's a duel ring.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:09.080
That was Solid Vision.

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:10.560
Crow!

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:11.510
Are you okay?

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:12.480
Crow!

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.680
Yeah, I guess.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.550
But more importantly, look at this.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.610
It's a duel ring.  Why is this here?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.890
It looks homemade.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.090
Hey!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.290
You don't have permission to enter here!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.720
Permission?

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:32.400
You're the one who flung me here, old man!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:35.020
Stop making excuses and leave!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.400
Wait, old man.

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:39.070
If you can duel, then why don't you duel me?

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.370
What?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.760
If I lose, I'll leave.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:47.040
But if I win, you go to Martha's place.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.460
Because you have this awesome ring!

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:54.340
We have to duel!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:57.690
I always wanted to battle in a duel ring!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:02.890
You think this place is fun?

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.360
Of course!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:10.800
Fine, but I'm tough!

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.800
Is he serious?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.810
Let Crow handle this.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.920
Duel!

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.270
I go first.  I draw!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.110
I summon Maternal Junk in defense position!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:37.490
I set one card and end my turn!

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.140
All right, it's my turn!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.810
I won't go easy on you 
just because you're old!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:43.920
I draw!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.310
I summon Vayu the Emblem of Honor!

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:54.610
I can Special Summon this from my 
hand when a Blackwing is on my field!

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.420
Appear, Bora the Spear!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.020
When it attacks a monster 
in defense position...

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:05.570
...if its attack points exceed your monster's 
defense points, you take the difference as damage!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.590
Go, Bora the Spear!

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.690
Death Spiral!

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:15.110
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.900
He uses a Junk Deck, just like me.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:28.610
After Scrap-Iron Scarecrow negates your 
monster's attack, I can set it on my field again!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.750
Looks like you have skills, old man!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.070
My turn.  I draw!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:04.680
Dad, this is incredible!  
It's like a real duel ring!

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:08.450
Incredible, right?  I built it just for you.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.580
Let's duel!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.030
What's wrong, old man?

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:21.770
Be quiet!  Don't talk!

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.250
I summon Paternal Junk!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:37.650
When Maternal Junk is on my field, 
this card gains 500 attack points!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:42.600
Next, I activate the Field Spell 
Junk Factory from my hand!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.260
What?

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:00.420
Junk monsters gain 500 attack points.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:06.640
Well done!  It instantly went up 
from 1600 to 2600 attack points!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.380
That worked beautifully.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:12.090
And if he brings the last one 
out, it'll be a straight flush.

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:14.330
This isn't the time to admire him.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.810
If Crow loses…

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:19.870
Don't worry.  Crow will do something.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:23.560
Let's battle!  Go, Paternal Junk!

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.920
You're doing better than I expected.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:36.800
But Vayu the Emblem of Honor is a special Tuner 
Monster that can Synchro Summon from the graveyard.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.940
My comeback is about to begin!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.860
Junk Factory's effect activates!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.710
What?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:46.710
With Junk Factory, when a Junk 
monster destroys your monster,

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:49.580
I can return your monster to your deck.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:12:00.850
What?  That means I can't use Vayu 
the Emblem of Honor's effect!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.470
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.670
Why won't he summon it?

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.840
Summon what?

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.610
My turn!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.570
I activate the spell card 
Black-Winged Strafe!

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.390
By sending a Blackwing in 
my hand to the graveyard,

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:23.690
I can destroy one monster 
in defense position!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:28.990
I send Shura the Blue Flame to the 
graveyard to destroy your Maternal Junk!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.770
I activate my trap Scrap-Iron Barricade!

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:40.770
The monster protected by this card can't 
be destroyed by card effects this turn!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:48.980
Similar to Scrap-Iron Scarecrow, Scrap-Iron 
Barricade is set after it activates.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:51.840
I'm not done yet!

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:55.150
I summon Blackwing - Blizzard the Far North!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.660
When it's successfully summoned,

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:05.460
I can Special Summon one Level 4-or-below 
Blackwing from my graveyard!

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:09.460
I Special Summon Blackwing – Shura 
the Blue Flame in defense position!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.830
I activate my trap Scrap-Iron Pitfall!

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.220
You still have more?

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:27.680
When you Special Summon a monster, Scrap-Iron 
Pitfall negates it and return it to your hand!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:28.820
What?

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:34.800
This card is also set instead 
of going to the graveyard.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.060
His field is full of junk traps.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:45.060
I was confident, but I might 
be in serious trouble.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.340
Crow's odds are turning worse.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:53.020
The three traps are simple but powerful.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.490
I activate the spell card Cards 
for Black Feathers from my hand!

00:13:57.490 --> 00:14:02.620
By sending a Blackwing in my hand to the 
graveyard, I can draw two cards from my deck.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:06.470
I send Shura the Blue Flame to 
the graveyard and draw two cards!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:14.100
When there's a Blackwing on my field, I can 
Special Summon Gale the Whirlwind from my hand!

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.970
I activate Gale the Whirlwind's effect!

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:21.000
One of your monsters' attack 
and defense points are halved!

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:28.110
Bora the Spear attacks Paternal Junk!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:32.670
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.880
Just like I thought...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.320
Then I set it again!

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:45.610
I won't fall for the same strategy twice!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.860
I'll continue the battle!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.890
Gale the Whirlwind attacks Paternal Junk!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:56.220
Gale the Whirlwind and Paternal 
Junk both have 1300 attack points.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.440
Does he want mutual destruction?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:02.450
I activate Kalut the Moon 
Shadow's effect from my hand!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:08.250
By sending this card to the graveyard, Gale 
the Whirlwind gains 1400 attack points!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.160
So that's what he was planning!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.360
Go, Gale the Whirlwind!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:25.840
All right!  My attack finally succeeded!

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:29.810
Congrats, kid!  But now my trap activates!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.280
What?  You still have another one?

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.960
Junk Spirit!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:39.070
When a Junk monster is destroyed in 
battle and sent to the graveyard,

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:43.270
I can Special Summon it during the End Phase!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:44.690
What?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:47.660
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:50.100
Return, Paternal Junk!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:57.000
Due to Maternal Junk and Junk Factory's 
effects, Paternal Junk gains 1000 attack points.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.870
Damn!  Everything is back to before!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.880
What a cunning old man.

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:04.840
Don't you think it's strange?

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:09.610
Yeah.  He stubbornly lives by himself, 
but he's obsessed with family.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:14.210
I see.  Paternal is the father 
and Maternal is the mother.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:18.120
But there's one card 
missing from that family.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.430
If he has Kid Junk on 
his field, Paternal Junk

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:24.530
gains 1000 points because it 
wants to protect its child.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:27.940
Paternal will have 3600 attack points.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:32.310
That's trouble.  If that 
happens, the old man will win.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:35.300
But if he wanted to do that, 
he would've done it already.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:41.600
Due to Paternal Junk and Maternal Junk's 
effects, he can add Kid Junk to his hand.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.940
What?  Then why doesn't he do that?

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:46.980
Who knows.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.320
Hey, where are you going?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.840
I'm going to look for the key card that'll 
determine the outcome of this duel.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:55.930
Key card?

00:16:56.470 --> 00:17:00.350
If my thinking is correct, 
Crow will stage a comeback.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.220
A comeback?

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.500
Hey, Yusei!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:12.190
I activate the Equip Spell Junk Barrage!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.430
I equip it on Paternal Junk!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:20.320
Battle!  Paternal Junk 
attacks Gale the Whirlwind!

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:32.380
When the monster equipped with Junk 
Barrage destroys your monster,

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:36.580
you take damage equal to half 
your monster's attack points!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.380
I lost a lot of life points!

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:46.780
What is it?

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:51.750
Due to the noise from this duel, the 
mountain of junk is starting to collapse!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.680
Crow, stop the duel!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.390
Right!  Old man, we have to escape!

00:17:56.390 --> 00:18:00.120
Whatever!  I'm continuing 
this duel to the end!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.640
You stubborn old man!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.960
I activate the trap Black Thunder!

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:09.160
When a Blackwing on my field 
is destroyed in battle,

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:13.220
you take 400 points of damage 
for every card on your field!

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.210
You have seven cards on your field!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:20.170
That's a total of 2800 points of damage!

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.730
Old man!

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:29.960
Crow!

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:30.920
Old man!

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:45.500
Crow!  Old man!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:51.940
We're safe!

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.940
You're fine.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.420
Kouki's ring…

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.000
Stop, old man!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.870
There's something important in my house!

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.190
Everyone, are you okay?

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:08.860
Yusei!

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:10.190
Where did you go?

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:18.020
Old man, the ring is destroyed, but isn't 
this what you wanted to take with you?

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.970
A family photo?

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:24.940
Old man, you had a family?

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.660
Yeah, I did.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:34.880
You never had Kid Junk in 
your deck from the beginning.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.150
What?

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:37.880
Yeah.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:42.070
I gave that card to my son Kouki.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.060
I'm a fool.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.130
I was so focused on my work 
that I never realized…

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:59.160
Everyone important to me was gone.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:07.180
As long as I had this duel ring, I 
thought my son would come back someday.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.490
That's why you didn't want to leave.

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:13.760
Old man…

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:18.830
I knew it could never happen.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.470
Old man…

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.170
You have sons!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:32.140
See?  Four grown-up sons!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:36.480
Yeah.  You'll have to teach me 
how to use a junk deck next time.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.480
Well, I'm willing to play 
you every now and then.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:44.950
And if you go to Martha's place, 
you'll have plenty of grandchildren.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.560
You guys…

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.870
Wow!  It's awesome!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.070
It's a work of art!

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:05.540
Thanks.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:10.380
It's great to see him so happy.

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:11.250
Yeah.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.250
Hey Crow.  Good timing.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:16.950
Massage my shoulders.  They're very tight.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:19.290
Why me?

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:23.890
You fool!  A son's job is to 
massage his father's shoulders!

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:25.080
Sheesh…

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.150
C'mon, Crow!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.900
He chose you, Crow!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.630
This feels good.

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.710
C'mon, harder.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:35.590
Like this?

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:37.360
Ouch!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.210
Are you okay, old man?

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:43.460
You fool!  Take care of the 
elderly, my stupid son!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:44.850
Sheesh...

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:14.530
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:19.530
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:24.430
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:29.440
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:34.310
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:41.250
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:45.120
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:50.990
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.900
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.900 --> 00:23:00.870
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:03.840
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:06.080
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:10.750
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.050 --> 00:23:13.620
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:17.090
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:20.320
At our special place
